{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2019-09-26 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'FDA Approves Abbott\'s "Low Dose," Recharge-Free Spinal Cord Stimulation System With Up To Ten Year Battery Life For People Living With Chronic Pain', 'text': 'FDA APPROVES ABBOTT\'S "LOW DOSE," RECHARGE-FREE SPINAL CORD STIMULATION SYSTEM WITH UP TO TEN YEAR BATTERY LIFE* FOR PEOPLE LIVING WITH CHRONIC PAIN.ABBOTT LABORATORIES - PROCLAIM XR IS CURRENTLY UNDER REVIEW FOR CE MARK.'}{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "FDA Approves Abbott's Low Dose Recharge-Free Spinal Cord Stimulation System with Up to Ten Year Battery Life", 'text': "Abbott announced the U.S. Food and Drug Administration has approved the company's Proclaim XR recharge-free neurostimulation system for people living with chronic pain. The Proclaim XR platform offers a low dose of Abbott's proprietary BurstDR stimulation waveform, which was created based on scientific insights from doctors and research to mimic natural patterns found in the brain. It works by using low doses of mild electrical pulses to change pain signals as they travel from the spinal cord to the brain. The delivery of lower doses of spinal cord stimulation helps extend the system's battery life, allowing people to experience pain relief, without the hassle of recharging, for up to 10 years. Abbott's low-energy stimulation is based on finding the lowest effective dose as determined by the treating clinician for select patients. It delivers BurstDR stimulation intermittently, at low energy levels, while allowing people to experience the same level of superior pain relief. Proclaim XR also uses familiar Apple mobile digital devices and Bluetooth wireless technology to help discreetly manage pain and fit seamlessly into a patient's lifestyle. The system was developed based on positive results from Abbott's <b>B</b>urstDR micr<b>O</b>dosing stimu<b>L</b>ation in <b>D</b>e-novo patients <b>(BOLD)</b> study, which showed 100% of 24 enrolled patients on a low-energy BurstDR dosing program experienced pain relief with less than six hours of battery use per day, while approximately 50% of those patients achieved pain relief with the lowest effective dose (less than two hours of battery use per day). Even at the highest settings, the systems were still in use only 25% of the time. Data from this trial was presented at multiple society meetings including the North American Neuromodulation Society (NANS) and the International Neuromodulation Society (INS) earlier this year."}{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'FDA Approves Treatment For Adults, Children With All Genotypes Of Hepatitis C And Compensated Cirrhosis', 'text': 'Sept 26  - Abbvie Inc <ABBV.N>::FDA APPROVES TREATMENT FOR ADULTS AND CHILDREN WITH ALL GENOTYPES OF HEPATITIS C AND COMPENSATED CIRRHOSIS THAT SHORTENS DURATION OF TREATMENT TO EIGHT WEEKS.U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION - EXPANDED APPROVAL OF MAVYRET (GLECAPREVIR AND PIBRENTASVIR) TABLETS.FDA SAYS GRANTED APPROVAL OF MAVYRET TO ABBVIE INC.'}{'symbol': 'ABMD', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Abiomed Announces PROTECT III Presented at TCT 2019 – Clinical Data Demonstrates Protected PCI with Impella is Associated with Improved Outcomes', 'text': 'Abiomed announced the results of PROTECT III, the ongoing, prospective, single-arm FDA post-approval study for the PMA approval of Impella 2.5 and Impella CP in high-risk PCI. PROTECT III follows the PROTECT II Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT). PROTECT III demonstrates a reduction in the primary endpoint of death, stroke, myocardial infarction and repeat procedures at 90 days with Impella-supported Protected PCI, compared to PROTECT II. Death, stroke, myocardial infarction and repeat procedures are known collectively as major adverse cardiac and cerebrovascular events (MACCE). The findings of this interim analysis on 898 patients were announced at the 31st Transcatheter Cardiovascular Therapeutics (TCT) conference by a member of the study’s steering committee, Jeffrey J. Popma, MD, the director of interventional cardiology clinical services at Beth Israel Deaconess Medical Center, and professor of medicine at Harvard Medical School. The PROTECT series of FDA clinical studies, which includes PROTECT I, the PROTECT II RCT and PROTECT III, is the largest-ever FDA study of hemodynamically supported high-risk PCI patients. The series has enrolled 1,366 patients as of July and includes the only FDA randomized controlled trial ever conducted for hemodynamically supported high-risk PCI.'}{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Accenture plc Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend, Payable on Nov. 15, 2019', 'text': 'Accenture plc’s Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.80 per share for shareholders of record at the close of business on Oct. 17, 2019. This dividend is payable on Nov. 15, 2019. In fiscal 2019, the company paid semi-annual cash dividends of $1.46 per share, equivalent to quarterly payments of $0.73 per share. The new quarterly dividend of $0.80 per share represents a 10% increase over the equivalent quarterly rate in fiscal 2019.'}{'symbol': 'ARE', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Alexandria Real Estate Equities, Inc. Acquires Redevelopment Project in Stanford Research Park', 'text': 'Alexandria Real Estate Equities, Inc. announced that it has acquired 3160 Porter Drive, a 92,000 RSF redevelopment project in Stanford Research Park, for $26 million.'}{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Allegion plc, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019', 'text': 'Allegion plc, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'A U.S. Citizen Files Lawsuit against Amazon.com Under a Newly Revived Provision of a U.S. Law for Trafficking in Seized Cuban Property', 'text': "A U.S. citizen has sued Amazon.com under a newly revived provision of a U.S. law that permits legal action by U.S. citizens or entities against companies profiting from property that was confiscated by the Cuban government. The lawsuit, filed in federal court in Miami, Florida by Daniel A. Gonzalez, comes several months after the U.S. lifted a 23-year-old suspension of a provision of the 1996 Helms-Burton Act. The provision allows certain U.S. nationals with claims to properties confiscated by the Cuban government to seek damages from companies trafficking in the property. Mr. Gonzalez, descendant of the original owner, holds title to 2,000 acres of land in the Oriente province of Cuba. The land is used to produce marabu charcoal for export to the U.S. According to the complaint, Amazon, benefited from and trafficked in the confiscated property by selling charcoal produced on the property on its website. Mr. Gonzalez stated that he only wishes his grandfather, Miguel Gonzalez Rodriguez, who originally purchased the land, could have seen the day when the suit was filed. He died in 1987—roughly 23 years after communist soldiers gave him and his family only seven days to leave the property with only their personal belongings. The lawsuit includes FOGO Charcoal, also alleged to have benefited from and trafficked in Mr. Gonzalez' seized property."}{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'American Airlines Group Says Flights To Haneda Available For Purchase Sept. 30', 'text': "Sept 26  - American Airlines Group Inc <AAL.O>::AMERICAN AIRLINES GROUP INC - FLIGHTS TO HANEDA AVAILABLE FOR PURCHASE SEPT. 30.AMERICAN AIRLINES GROUP INC - LAUNCHES NEW SERVICE TO TOKYO'S HANEDA AIRPORT (HND) FROM DALLAS FORT WORTH AIRPORT (DFW) AND LAX.AMERICAN AIRLINES - BEGINNING MARCH 29, AMERICAN AND ITS PACIFIC JOINT BUSINESS PARTNER JAPAN AIRLINES WILL OFFER A TOTAL OF FIVE DAILY FLIGHTS TO HND."}{'symbol': 'AXP', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "American Express Company Presents at L'ATTITUDE, Sep-27-2019 01:15 PM", 'text': "American Express Company Presents at L'ATTITUDE, Sep-27-2019 01:15 PM. Venue: Grand Hyatt, Market Place, San Diego, California, United States. Speakers: Clayton Rubensaal, EVP Global B2B Marketing."}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'American Water Wins Joint Base San Antonio Water and Wastewater Treatment Contract', 'text': 'American Water announced its Military Services Group has been awarded a contract for ownership, operation and maintenance of the water and wastewater systems at Joint Base San Antonio (JBSA) in Texas. JBSA is comprised of Randolph Air Force Base, Fort Sam Houston, Camp Bullis, and Lackland Air Force Base. The installation expands across 11 geographically separated parcels of land and over 46,539 acres in support of 266 military service mission partners. The total contract value as awarded is approximately $448 million over a 50-year period. The contract will be subject to an annual economic price adjustment. JBSA is home to the high number of students, the most active runways, and the large hospital and Level I trauma center across all of the Department of Defense’s installations. JBSA supports over 250,000 personnel, directly or indirectly supporting over 187,000 jobs across Texas and contributes $30 billion annually to the state’s economy.'}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'ANSYS, Inc. Multiphysics Solutions Achieve Certification on TSMC N5P and N6 Process Technologies', 'text': "ANSYS, Inc. has achieved certification for its suite of semiconductor solutions on the latest version of TSMC's N5P and N6 process technologies, empowering mutual customers to meet increasing demands for the next generation of innovations in 5G, artificial intelligence (AI), cloud and data center applications. The ANSYS Totem and ANSYS RedHawk family of multiphysics solutions are certified on TSMC's N5P and N6 process technologies. The certification includes extraction, power integrity and reliability, signal line electromigration (EM) and thermal reliability analysis for self-heat, thermal-aware EM and statistical EM budgeting analysis. Mutual customers are enabled for low-power and high-performance designs with greater functional integration."}{'symbol': 'ANTM', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Anthem, Inc. (NYSE:ANTM) entered into an agreement to acquire Missouri and Nebraska Medicaid plans from WellCare Health Plans, Inc. (NYSE:WCG).', 'text': 'Anthem, Inc. (NYSE:ANTM) entered into an agreement to acquire Missouri and Nebraska Medicaid plans from WellCare Health Plans, Inc. (NYSE:WCG) on September 26, 2019. WellCare Health Plans, Inc. employees, who operate and manage these plans will, become part of Anthem, Inc. The transaction is subject to U.S. federal antitrust clearance, receipt of Missouri and Nebraska state regulatory approvals and other customary closing conditions, as well as the closing of the Centene Corporation and WellCare Health Plans, Inc. transaction. Evercore acted as financial advisor and Skadden, Arps, Slate, Meagher & Flom LLP acted as legal advisor for Centene Corporation, in connection with the sale. Kirkland & Ellis LLP, Locke Lord LLP, and Bass Berry & Sims PLC acted as legal advisors for WellCare Health Plans, Inc.\n'}{'symbol': 'AON', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Aon plc Introduces A Claims Analysis Platform That Enables Insurers to Accelerate Their Claims Processing and Improve Customer Experience', 'text': 'Aon has introduced a claims analysis platform that enables insurers to accelerate their claims processing and improve customer experience. The AI-powered solution, known as ClaimsMonitor.X, was developed in collaboration with US-based insurtech firm CLARA analytics. Leveraging natural language processing, the platform reads claims notes to determine whether the claim adjusters are adhering to the best practices.  In case the platform detects that the claim adjusters not following the best practices, it sends an alert to the concerned supervisor.'}{'symbol': 'ADM', 'date': '2019-09-26 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Western Potash Corp Executes Binding Offtake Agreement With ADM', 'text': 'WESTERN POTASH CORP EXECUTES BINDING OFFTAKE AGREEMENT WITH ADM.WESTERN RESOURCES - UNIT ENTERED BINDING OFFTAKE AGREEMENT WITH ARCHER DANIELS MIDLAND FOR 100% OF POTASH PRODUCTION FROM MILESTONE PHASE I PLANT.WESTERN RESOURCES - PROJECT GOAL REMAINS TO COMPLETE PHASE I CONSTRUCTION IN MID 2020 WITH POTASH PRODUCTION TO COMMENCE LATER IN 2020.'}{'symbol': 'ADM', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Western Potash Corp Executes Binding Offtake Agreement with Archer Daniels Midland Company', 'text': 'Western Resources Corp. announced that Western Potash Corp. entered into a binding offtake agreement with Archer Daniels Midland Company for 100% of the potash production (146,000 tonnes per annum) from the Milestone Phase I plant. Key terms of the offtake agreement include: Binding commitment to take 100% of the produced potash from the Phase I project; Free-on-board (FOB) mine site and transported from the site by truck to the nearby Port Lajord Terminal, only 13 kilometers from the project site; A structure to incentivize the best final sale price for both parties.'}{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'AT&T Inc. Presents at In-Memory Computing Summit North America, Nov-13-2019', 'text': 'AT&T Inc. Presents at In-Memory Computing Summit North America, Nov-13-2019 . Venue: Hyatt Regency San Francisco Airport, San Francisco, California, United States. Speakers: Ezat Karimi.'}{'symbol': 'ADP', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Automatic Data Processing, Inc., Annual General Meeting, Nov 12, 2019', 'text': 'Automatic Data Processing, Inc., Annual General Meeting, Nov 12, 2019, at 10:00 US Eastern Standard Time. Location: One ADP Boulevard Roseland New Jersey United States Agenda: To consider election of directors; to consider advisory vote on Executive Compensation; and to consider ratification of the Appointment of Auditors.'}{'symbol': 'AZO', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'G. Research, LLC, 43rd Annual Automotive Aftermarket Symposium, Nov 04, 2019 through Nov 05, 2019', 'text': 'G. Research, LLC, 43rd Annual Automotive Aftermarket Symposium, Nov 04, 2019 through Nov 05, 2019. Venue: Waldorf Astoria, Las Vegas, Nevada, United States. The research meeting will feature presentations by senior management of several leading automotive companies with an emphasis on industry dynamics, technical innovation, EV, and macroeconomic trends.'}{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Bank of America Corporation, Bank of America Industrial IoT & Automation Summit, Sep 26, 2019', 'text': 'Bank of America Corporation, Bank of America Industrial IoT & Automation Summit, Sep 26, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'BAX', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'European Society of Intensive Care Medicine, 2019 European Society of Intensive Care Medicine LIVES congress, Sep 28, 2019 through Oct 02, 2019', 'text': 'European Society of Intensive Care Medicine, 2019 European Society of Intensive Care Medicine LIVES congress, Sep 28, 2019 through Oct 02, 2019. Venue: Berlin, Germany.'}{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2019-09-26 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'BD Says Thomas E. Polen Appointed Chief Executive Officer', 'text': "BD ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP SUCCESSION PLAN.BECTON DICKINSON AND CO - VINCENT A. FORLENZA TO CONTINUE AS EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN OF BOARD.BECTON DICKINSON AND CO - THOMAS E. POLEN APPOINTED CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER.BECTON DICKINSON AND CO - POLEN WILL BE NOMINATED FOR DIRECTOR AT COMPANY'S ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS..BECTON DICKINSON AND CO - VINCENT A. FORLENZA, CHAIRMAN AND CEO, WILL RETIRE AS CEO ON JAN. 28, 2020."}{'symbol': 'BBY', 'date': '2019-09-26 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Best Buy Sees Fiscal 2025 Enterprise Revenue Of $50 Bln', 'text': 'BEST BUY PROVIDES INVESTOR UPDATE ON BUILDING THE NEW BLUE GROWTH STRATEGY.BEST BUY CO INC - SEES 2025 NON-GAAP OPERATING INCOME RATE OF 5.0%.BEST BUY CO INC -SEES FOR FISCAL 2025 ENTERPRISE REVENUE OF $50 BILLION.BEST BUY CO INC -  SETTING TARGETS FOR FISCAL 2025 OF $1 BILLION OF ADDITIONAL COST REDUCTIONS AND EFFICIENCIES.'}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'BlackRock, Inc. Presents at Annual North America Conference, Sep-26-2019 09:40 AM', 'text': 'BlackRock, Inc. Presents at Annual North America Conference, Sep-26-2019 09:40 AM. Venue: Convene, One Liberty Plaza, Financial District, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Jack Hattem, ISDA Board Member, Managing Director, Global Fixed Income.'}{'symbol': 'BSX', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Boston Scientific Announces Positive Data from the EVOLVE Short DAPT study with the SYNERGY™ Bioabsorbable Polymer Stent', 'text': 'Boston Scientific has announced primary endpoint results from the EVOLVE Short DAPT clinical trial, the first prospective study initiated in the U.S. to examine the safety of a shortened duration of dual antiplatelet therapy (DAPT) in patients at high risk for bleeding. Results were presented during a late-breaking clinical science session at the 31st Transcatheter Cardiovascular Therapeutics (TCT), the annual scientific symposium of the Cardiovascular Research Foundation, in San Francisco, and demonstrated that a three-month regimen of DAPT is non-inferior to a 12-month or longer regimen in patients with an increased risk of bleeding after being treated with the SYNERGY™ Bioabsorbable Polymer (BP) Stent. Patients within the trial were implanted with at least one SYNERGY BP stent and considered at high risk for bleeding after meeting at least one of the criteria such as: age of 75 or older with the risk of longer term DAPT deemed greater than the benefit, a history of stroke, renal insufficiency or failure, the need for chronic anticoagulation therapy or history of major bleeding in the prior 12 months. The co-primary endpoints of the study assessed the rate of death or myocardial infarction (MI) and the rate of stent thrombosis between three and 15 months. Both primary endpoints were successfully met. The global EVOLVE Short DAPT trial enrolled 2,009 patients and of those, 1,487 patients were eligible to discontinue dual-antiplatelet therapy at three months. In patients treated with a short DAPT regimen, investigators found that the rate of death or MI between three and 15 months was non-inferior in the three-month DAPT group compared to a historical control group of patients treated with 12-month DAPT (5.6% vs. 5.7%, p-value for non-inferiority was 0.002). Additionally, the rate of stent thrombosis between three and 15 months in the patients treated with three-month DAPT was 0.3%, significantly lower than the endpoint performance goal of 1.0%. This month, the company received CE Mark for the SYNERGY MEGATRON™ Bioabsorbable Polymer (BP) Stent, the newest stent within the SYNERGY family of products. The SYNERGY MEGATRON BP stent is designed for use in large proximal vessels and features architecture with increased strength as well as the ability to expand to 6.0mm in diameter and accommodate tapered vessels.'}{'symbol': 'AVGO', 'date': '2019-09-26 06:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Broadcom Says Upsized & Priced Public Offering Of 3.25 Mln Shares Of 8.00% Series A Mandatory Convertible Preferred Stock', 'text': 'ANNOUNCES PRICING AND UPSIZING OF MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK OFFERING.UPSIZED & PRICED A PUBLIC OFFERING OF 3.25 MILLION SHARES OF 8.00% SERIES A MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK AT $1,000 PER SHARE.OFFERING WAS UPSIZED FROM PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED $3.0 BILLION OF SHARES OF MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK.'}{'symbol': 'CPB', 'date': '2019-09-26 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Campbell Soup Sets Regular Quarterly Dividend Of $0.35/Shr', 'text': 'SETS REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.35PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'COF', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Capital One Financial Corporation Presents at CyberNext Summit 2019, Oct-09-2019 01:00 PM', 'text': 'Capital One Financial Corporation Presents at CyberNext Summit 2019, Oct-09-2019 01:00 PM. Venue: Washington\xa0, District Of Columbia, United States. Speakers: Marita Fowler.'}{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2019-09-26 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Carnival Q3 Adjusted Earnings Per Share $2.63', 'text': 'ORATION & PLC REPORTS RECORD THIRD QUARTER EARNINGS.SEES FY 2019 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $4.23 TO $4.27.Q3 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.63.Q3 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.58.Q3 REVENUE $6.5 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $6.16 BILLION.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $2.53 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.SEES Q4 2019 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.46 TO $0.50.CUMULATIVE ADVANCED BOOKINGS FOR FIRST HALF OF 2020 ARE AHEAD OF PRIOR YEAR.SINCE JUNE, BOTH BOOKING VOLUMES AND PRICES FOR FIRST HALF OF NEXT YEAR HAVE BEEN RUNNING LOWER.Q4 CONSTANT CURRENCY NET REVENUE YIELDS ARE EXPECTED TO BE DOWN 2.0 TO 3.0 PERCENT COMPARED TO PRIOR YEAR.SEES FY 2020 CAPACITY GROWTH OF APPROXIMATELY 7 PERCENT.QTRLY GROSS CRUISE REVENUES OF $6.3 BILLION COMPARED TO $5.7 BILLION FOR PRIOR YEAR.NET CRUISE COSTS EXCLUDING FUEL PER ALBD IN CONSTANT CURRENCY FOR Q4 ARE EXPECTED TO BE UP 4.0% TO 5.0% COMPARED TO PRIOR YEAR.USING Q4 SEPTEMBER GUIDANCE FUEL PRICES, FUEL EXPENSE FOR FULL YEAR 2020 IS EXPECTED TO BE $1.8 BILLION.CURRENTLY EXPECTS DEPRECIATION TO BE APPROXIMATELY $2.4 BILLION FOR FULL YEAR 2020.FACING A NUMBER OF CURRENT HEADWINDS, INCLUDING WEAKENING ECONOMIES AFFECTING OUR EUROPE & ASIA SEGMENT.FACING A NUMBER OF CURRENT HEADWINDS, INCLUDING A STRONG DOLLAR AND IMO 2020 REGULATIONS.WORKING TO MITIGATE A NUMBER OF CURRENT HEADWINDS.IN CONSTANT CURRENCY, NET CRUISE REVENUES OF $5.0 BILLION FOR Q3 COMPARED TO $4.7 BILLION FOR PRIOR YEAR, AN INCREASE OF 5.3 PERCENT.'}{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Carnival Corporation & Plc Revises Earnings Guidance for the Year Fourth Quarter and Year of 2019', 'text': 'Carnival Corporation & Plc revised earnings guidance for the year fourth quarter and year of 2019. A further reduction in guidance for ticket and onboard revenue worth $0.06 per share in part contributed to by the high level of close-in voyage disruptions was also offset. However, due to an $0.08 impact from the recent spike in fuel prices caused by geopolitical events, the company is reducing full year guidance for 2019 by $0.05 per share. Based on current booking trends, the company expects full year 2019 constant currency net cruise revenues to be up approximately 4.0%, with capacity growth of 4.2%. For the fourth quarter of 2019, the company expects changes in fuel prices and currency exchange rates are expected to increase earnings by $0.06 per share compared to the prior year.'}{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2019-09-26 17:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Carnival Corporation, Government Of The Bahamas Sign Agreements To Develop Two New Destination Projects', 'text': 'CARNIVAL CORPORATION, GOVERNMENT OF THE BAHAMAS SIGN AGREEMENTS TO DEVELOP TWO NEW DESTINATION PROJECTS.CARNIVAL CORP - GRAND BAHAMA PROJECT WILL REPRESENT AN INVESTMENT OF OVER $100 MILLION.CARNIVAL CORP - UNDER AGREEMENT, CARNIVAL CORPORATION WILL DEVELOP A NEW CRUISE PORT DESTINATION PRIMARILY FOR CARNIVAL CRUISE LINE ON GRAND BAHAMA.CARNIVAL CORP - UNDER AGREEMENT, CARNIVAL CORPORATION WILL CONSTRUCT A NEW ADDITION, INCLUDING A PIER, ON BAHAMIAN ISLAND OF LITTLE SAN SALVADOR.CARNIVAL CORP - DEVELOPMENT ON LITTLE SAN SALVADOR WILL BE AN ESTIMATED $80 MILLION INVESTMENT OVER TIME.CARNIVAL CORP - ONCE ENVIRONMENTAL AND OTHER PERMITTING PROCESSES ARE COMPLETED, CONSTRUCTION FOR BOTH PROJECTS IS PROJECTED TO START BY MID-2020.'}{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cigna Corporation Announces Exchange Offers and Consent Solicitations for Senior Notes of Cigna Holding Company, Express Scripts Holding Company and Medco Health Solutions, Inc', 'text': 'Cigna Corporation announced the commencement of private offers to exchangeany and all of certain outstanding notes issued by Cigna’s wholly-owned subsidiaries, Cigna Holding Company, Express Scripts Holding Company and Medco Health Solutions Inc. (collectively, the “Existing Notes”) for (1) new senior notes to be issued by Cigna (the “New Cigna Notes”) and (2) cash, subject to the terms and conditions set forth in Cigna’s confidential offering memorandum and consent solicitation statement, dated September 26, 2019 (the “Offering Memorandum and Consent Solicitation Statement”). In connection with the Exchange Offers, Cigna is also soliciting consents from holders of the Existing Notes to amend the indentures governing the Existing Notes to eliminate certain of the covenants, restrictive provisions, reporting requirements, events of default and related provisions therein, subject to the terms and conditions set forth in the Offering Memorandum and Consent Solicitation Statement. If the Proposed Amendments are adopted, certain terms of the Existing Notes will be less restrictive and will afford reduced protection to holders of the Existing Notes compared to those terms and protections currently in the indenture governing Cigna’s existing senior notes or those terms and protections that will be applicable to the New Cigna Notes. Other than with respect to the 8.30% 2023 notes issued by Cigna Holding Company, the 7.65% 2023 notes issued by Cigna Holding Company, the 7.865% 2027 notes issued by Cigna Holding Company and the 8.30% 2033 step-down notes issued by Cigna Holding Company (collectively, the “Super-Majority Notes”), the consent of the holders of a majority of the aggregate principal amount of the Existing Notes outstanding of each series will be required in order to effectuate the Proposed Amendments to the Existing Indenture for each such series. With respect to the Super-Majority Notes, the consent of holders of 662/3% of the aggregate principal amount of the Super-Majority Notes outstanding of each series will be required in order to effectuate the Proposed Amendments to the Existing Indenture for each series.'}{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Lattitude, L'ATTITUDE, Sep 26, 2019 through Sep 29, 2019", 'text': "Lattitude, L'ATTITUDE, Sep 26, 2019 through Sep 29, 2019. Venue: Grand Hyatt, Market Place, San Diego, California, United States."}{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Citigroup Inc. has completed a Fixed-Income Offering in the amount of $5.072 million.', 'text': 'Citigroup Inc. has completed a Fixed-Income Offering in the amount of $5.072 million.\n\nSecurity Name: Step-Up Senior Unsecured Notes due September 30, 2034\nSecurity Type: Corporate Bond/Note (Non Convertible)\nPrincipal Amount: $5.072 million\nPrice\\Range: 100%\nDiscount Per Security: 1.75%\nSecurity Features: Callable; MTN\nCoupon Type: Step-Up\n'}{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2019-09-26 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Conagra Brands Reports Q1 Adjusted Earnings Per Share $0.43', 'text': 'CONAGRA BRANDS REPORTS FIRST QUARTER RESULTS.Q1 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.43.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.36 FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.39 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.36.REAFFIRMS FISCAL 2020 GUIDANCE.NET SALES FOR GROCERY & SNACKS SEGMENT INCREASED 26.9% TO $978 MILLION IN QUARTER.NET SALES FOR REFRIGERATED & FROZEN SEGMENT INCREASED 51.0% TO $959 MILLION IN QUARTER.QTRLY NET SALES $2,390.7 MILLION VERSUS $1,834.4 MILLION.Q1 REVENUE VIEW $2.48 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.CONTINUES TO EXPECT SECOND HALF RESULTS TO SHOW STRONGER ORGANIC NET SALES GROWTH AND ADJUSTED EPS GROWTH THAN FIRST HALF.IN QUARTER, COMPANY REDUCED ITS TOTAL GROSS DEBT BY $148 MILLION AS COMPARED TO END OF Q4 OF FISCAL 2019.'}{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Conagra Brands, Inc. Reaffirms Financial Guidance for Fiscal 2020', 'text': 'Conagra Brands, Inc. reaffirmed financial guidance for fiscal 2020. For the year, the company expects organic net sales growth of 1.0% to 1.5% and reported net sales growth of 13.5% to 14.0%.'}{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2019-09-26 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Constellation Brands Elects New Board Members', 'text': "CONSTELLATION BRANDS ELECTS NEW BOARD MEMBERS.CONSTELLATION BRANDS INC - ELECTION INCREASES SIZE OF CONSTELLATION'S BOARD FROM 10 TO 12 MEMBERS.CONSTELLATION BRANDS INC - ELECTION OF CHRISTY CLARK AND JOSE MANUEL MADERO TO SERVE AS MEMBERS OF ITS BOARD."}{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hyundai Motor Company and Cummins Inc. to Collaborate on Hydrogen Fuel Cell Technology', 'text': 'Hyundai Motor Company and Cummins Inc. announced that the two global powertrain leaders have entered into a memorandum of understanding (MOU) to jointly evaluate opportunities to develop and commercialize electric and fuel cell powertrains. These new powertrains are expected to be developed by combining Hyundai’s fuel cell systems with Cummins’ electric powertrain, battery, and control technologies. The initial development will be focused on the North American commercial vehicle market, including working with North American OEMs on the integration of these systems into their vehicles. The companies will also explore ways they can work together to develop next generation fuel cell systems, and have each committed to assign a team of individuals to investigate and pursue other areas of collaboration. This partnership provides a springboard for Hyundai Motor Company to increase its presence in the North American commercial vehicle market, and Cummins to enhance its electrified power product portfolio by adding Hyundai’s advanced fuel cell technologies. The new collaboration may extend beyond the commercial vehicle market, as the companies will also evaluate the development of fuel cell power generators. The availability of reliable back-up power generation to prevent data loss in emergency situations is a business-critical requirement for many organizations. Fuel cell back-up power generation is attractive for its reduced carbon footprint.'}{'symbol': 'DHI', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Forestar Prices Public Offering Of Common Stock', 'text': 'FORESTAR PRICES PUBLIC OFFERING OF COMMON STOCK.SAYS PUBLIC OFFERING OF 5.25 MILLION COMMON SHARES PRICED AT $17.50PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'DE', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Deere & Company Launches Powerful Felling Heads', 'text': 'Deere & Company announced the addition of the FS50/FR50 Felling Heads to the felling head line-up. The FS50/FR50 Felling Heads build upon the successful qualities of previous models for increased productivity, range and visibility. The new felling heads are compatible with the 800M- and 900M-Series Tracked Feller Bunchers and feature in 30-degree and 310-degree wrist configurations respectively. The FS50/FR50 features superior alignment of bunched timber to allow for optimal logging and harvesting. The new felling heads provide a taller horn that works together with the pocket and arms to collect larger, tighter bunches. The horn delivers excellent handling of tall trees, which improves skidder productivity during tree removal. Both models also include arm cylinders mounted high for impressive wear protection of the saw housing, and can easily hold up to 15 six-inch trees. Additionally, the FS50/FR50 models provide excellent visibility to the cutting area and superior wear protection of saw housing. A full coverage option is available for both models, and for the FR50 model, sealed bushings in all clamp arm pivot joints are available.'}{'symbol': 'DAL', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Delta Air Lines, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 10, 2019', 'text': 'Delta Air Lines, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 10, 2019'}{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2019-09-26 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dominion Energy Acquires Two Solar Projects In Virginia', 'text': 'DOMINION ENERGY ACQUIRES TWO SOLAR PROJECTS IN VIRGINIA.DOMINION ENERGY INC - FACILITIES ARE EXPECTED TO BE OPERATIONAL IN 2020..DOMINION ENERGY INC - LONG-TERM POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENTS WITH T-MOBILE USA.DOMINION ENERGY INC - ANNOUNCED A TARGET TO REDUCE CARBON EMISSIONS FROM ITS POWER GENERATING FACILITIES 80 PERCENT BETWEEN 2005 AND 2050.DOMINION ENERGY INC - 15-MEGAWATT MYRTLE SOLAR PROJECT IS EXPECTED TO ENTER SERVICE IN Q2 OF 2020.DOMINION ENERGY INC - 80-MEGAWATT GREENSVILLE SOLAR FACILITY, IN GREENSVILLE COUNTY, IS TARGETED TO COME ONLINE IN LATE 2020.DOMINION ENERGY INC - POWER GENERATED AT TWO SITES WILL GO TO TELECOMMUNICATIONS COMPANY T-MOBILE USA, INC., UNDER LONG-TERM CONTRACTS..'}{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2019-09-26 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'DTE Energy Announced Goal To Achieve Net Zero Carbon Emissions In Its Electric Company By 2050', 'text': 'NET ZERO CARBON EMISSIONS GOAL ANNOUNCED BY DTE ENERGY ELECTRIC COMPANY.DTE ENERGY CO - ANNOUNCED A GOAL TO ACHIEVE NET ZERO CARBON EMISSIONS IN ITS ELECTRIC COMPANY BY 2050..DTE ENERGY CO - EXPECTS TO DOUBLE ITS INVESTMENT IN MICHIGAN-MADE RENEWABLES IN NEXT FIVE YEARS.'}{'symbol': 'EA', 'date': '2019-09-26 17:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'EA Says Medal Of Honor: Above And Beyond Coming Exclusively For VR, On Oculus Rift', 'text': 'ELECTRONIC ARTS - RESPAWN ENTERTAINMENT & OCULUS REVEALED MEDAL OF HONOR: ABOVE AND BEYOND, COMING NEXT YEAR EXCLUSIVELY TO VR, ON OCULUS RIFT PLATFORM.'}{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Exelon Corporation(NasdaqGS:EXC) added to NASDAQ Composite Index', 'text': 'Exelon Corporation has been added to NASDAQ Composite Index .'}{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Vår Energi AS signed an agreement to acquire Upstream Portfolio in Norway from Exxon Mobil Corporation (NYSE:XOM) for $4.5 billion.', 'text': 'Vår Energi AS signed an agreement to acquire Upstream Portfolio in Norway from Exxon Mobil Corporation (NYSE:XOM) for $4.5 billion on September 26, 2019. The consideration is payable in cash and is subject to closing adjustments. The transaction includes sale of ownership interest in 20 producing fields. The transaction will be financed from existing cash resources and a reserve based lending debt facility which has been fully underwritten by BNP Paribas and will subsequently be syndicated. Majority of the about 50 employees working on the fields will be retained by Vår Energi. The transaction is subject to standard conditions precedent, including customary approvals from regulatory authorities and is expected to complete in fourth quarter of 2019. BNP Paribas SA acted as financial advisor to Vår Energi AS. Jefferies LLC acted as financial advisor to Exxon Mobil Corporation. Mario Todino of Jones Day (Brussels) acted as legal advisor to ENI, parent of Vår Energi AS.\n'}{'symbol': 'FB', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Facebook In Talks For Sandberg To Testify To House Next Month- Bloomberg', 'text': 'Sept 26  - :FACEBOOK IN TALKS FOR SANDBERG TO TESTIFY TO HOUSE NEXT MONTH- BLOOMBERG.'}{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Fidelity National Information Services, Inc. Presents at Annual North America Conference, Sep-26-2019 04:00 PM', 'text': 'Fidelity National Information Services, Inc. Presents at Annual North America Conference, Sep-26-2019 04:00 PM. Venue: Convene, One Liberty Plaza, Financial District, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Ed Hellaby, Business Development Director  Collateral Management.'}{'symbol': 'FTV', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Fortive Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019', 'text': 'Fortive Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'FCX', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Freeport-McMoRan Inc. Presents at Jefferies Copper & Base Metals Summit, Sep-25-2019', 'text': 'Freeport-McMoRan Inc. Presents at Jefferies Copper & Base Metals Summit, Sep-25-2019 . Venue: Jefferies Conference Centre, New York, United States.'}{'symbol': 'GPC', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Genuine Parts Company Presents at 43rd Annual Automotive Aftermarket Symposium, Nov-05-2019 10:00 AM', 'text': 'Genuine Parts Company Presents at 43rd Annual Automotive Aftermarket Symposium, Nov-05-2019 10:00 AM. Venue: Waldorf Astoria, Las Vegas, Nevada, United States.'}{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc. Presents at Annual North America Conference, Sep-26-2019', 'text': 'The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc. Presents at Annual North America Conference, Sep-26-2019. Venue: Convene, One Liberty Plaza, Financial District, New York, New York, United States. Presentation Date & Speakers: Sep-26-2019, Marta Poleszczuk, Fixed Income Market Structure Strategy, Wendy Yun, Managing Director and Associate General Counsel.'}{'symbol': 'HIG', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'the Hartford Appoints Deepa Soni as Chief Information Officer', 'text': 'The Hartford announced that it has appointed Deepa Soni as chief information officer, effective Sept. 30. She succeeds Mark Esposito, who is retiring after a 13-year career with The Hartford. Soni will report to Bill Bloom, head of operations, technology, data and analytics at The Hartford. Soni will be responsible for the enterprise’s information technology applications and architecture. She brings more than 20 years of technology experience in the financial services industry. Most recently, Soni served as U.S. chief information officer for BMO Financial Group, where she led innovative technology strategies resulting in frictionless customer and employee experiences, improved productivity, while modernizing the technology systems. Her previous roles include head of application development at M&T Bank and head of enterprise architecture at KeyBank, where she oversaw digital transformation, business solution delivery, enterprise architecture and business process optimization.'}{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Honeywell International Inc. Presents at Bank of America Industrial IoT & Automation Summit, Sep-26-2019', 'text': 'Honeywell International Inc. Presents at Bank of America Industrial IoT & Automation Summit, Sep-26-2019 .'}{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Huntington Bancshares Incorporated, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019', 'text': 'Huntington Bancshares Incorporated, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'IEX', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'IDEX Corporation Declares Regular Quarterly Cash Dividend, Payable on October 31, 2019', 'text': 'IDEX Corporation announced that its Board of Directors has approved a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.50 per common share. The next dividend will be paid October 31, 2019 to shareholders of record as of October 16, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'INFO', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'IHS Markit Ltd. Presents at Euromoney Latin America Syndicated Loans Conference 2019, Sep-27-2019 12:45 PM', 'text': 'IHS Markit Ltd. Presents at Euromoney Latin America Syndicated Loans Conference 2019, Sep-27-2019 12:45 PM. Venue: Miami, Florida, United States. Speakers: John Olesky, Global Co-head Loan Platforms.'}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'GridGain Systems, Inc., In-Memory Computing Summit North America, Nov 13, 2019 through Nov 14, 2019', 'text': 'GridGain Systems, Inc., In-Memory Computing Summit North America, Nov 13, 2019 through Nov 14, 2019. Venue: Hyatt Regency San Francisco Airport, San Francisco, California, United States.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'International Business Machines Corporation Presents at CyberNext Summit 2019, Oct-10-2019 03:30 PM', 'text': 'International Business Machines Corporation Presents at CyberNext Summit 2019, Oct-10-2019 03:30 PM. Venue: Washington\xa0, District Of Columbia, United States. Speakers: Michael Lyons.'}{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Johnson & Johnson Presents at Biopharma Conclave 2019, Sep-26-2019', 'text': 'Johnson & Johnson Presents at Biopharma Conclave 2019, Sep-26-2019 . Venue: The St. Regis Mumbai, 462, Tulsi Pipe Rd, Lower Parel, Mumbai\xa0, Maharashtra, India. Speakers: Lalit Raute, Manager- Market Access.'}{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'JPMorgan Chase & Co. Presents at Annual North America Conference, Sep-26-2019 11:55 AM', 'text': 'JPMorgan Chase & Co. Presents at Annual North America Conference, Sep-26-2019 11:55 AM. Venue: Convene, One Liberty Plaza, Financial District, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Debbie Toennies, Managing Director  Head of Regulatory Affairs Corporate and Investment Bank.'}{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Keysight Technologies, Qualcomm Extend 5G Collaboration to Accelerate Commercialization of Dynamic Spectrum Sharing Technology', 'text': 'Keysight Technologies, Inc. announced an extended collaboration with Qualcomm Technologies Inc., a wholly owned subsidiary of Qualcomm Incorporated, to accelerate commercialization of Dynamic Spectrum Sharing (DSS) technology, which will enable mobile operators to quickly and cost-effectively roll out 5G new radio (NR) services. The collaboration utilizes Keysight’s 5G network emulation solutions to accelerate the development of Qualcomm® Snapdragon™ 5G Modem-RF System to support DSS, an emerging technology that is part of the 3GPP Release 15. By 2020, mobile operators are expected to start implementing DSS on existing 4G LTE base stations, speeding nationwide deployments of 5G services. DSS allows mobile operators to transform LTE base stations via a software upgrade to create hybrid 4G/5G base stations. As a result, users of DSS-capable 5G NR devices can access 5G services in urban and rural environments. DSS enables a mobile operator to flexibly use existing spectrum allocations across low-, mid- and high- frequency bands by dynamically switching between LTE and 5G NR coverage based on traffic demand. Mobile operators can leverage DSS to deliver the best possible performance and coverage for a mix of 4G and 5G devices. Keysight’s 5G network emulation solutions, widely adopted across the mobile ecosystem, allows users to cost-effectively validate multi-radio access technology (RAT) designs on a single platform.'}{'symbol': 'LRCX', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Lam Research Corporation has filed a Shelf Registration in the amount of $724.8 million.', 'text': 'Lam Research Corporation has filed a Shelf Registration in the amount of $724.8 million.\n\nSecurity Name: Common Stock\nSecurities Offered: 3,000,000\nTransaction Features: ESOP Related Offering'}{'symbol': 'LRCX', 'date': '2019-09-26 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Lam Research Says CEO's FY 2019 Total Compensation Was $13.7 Mln", 'text': "LAM RESEARCH CORP SAYS CEO TIMOTHY ARCHER'S FY 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $13.7 MILLION VERSUS $7.1 MILLION IN FY 2018 - SEC FILING.LAM RESEARCH CORP SAYS CEO TIMOTHY ARCHER'S FY 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION INCLUDED $3.9 MILLION IN OPTION AWARDS.LAM RESEARCH CORP SAYS CFO DOUGLAS BETTINGER'S FY 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $11.8 MILLION.LAM RESEARCH SAYS FOR FISCAL YEAR 2019, RATIO OF CEO ANNUAL TOTAL COMPENSATION TO ANNUAL TOTAL COMPENSATION OF MEDIAN COMPENSATED EMPLOYEE WAS 144 TO 1."}{'symbol': 'LW', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Lamb Weston Holdings Declares Quarterly Dividend, Payable on November 29, 2019', 'text': 'The Board of Directors of Lamb Weston Holdings, Inc. declared a quarterly dividend of $0.20 per share of Lamb Weston common stock. The dividend is payable on November 29, 2019, to stockholders of record at the close of business on November 1, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'LVS', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Las Vegas Sands Corp.(NYSE:LVS) added to S&P 500 EQUAL WEIGHTED', 'text': 'Las Vegas Sands Corp.(NYSE:LVS) added to S&P 500 EQUAL WEIGHTED'}{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Lennar Announces Grand Opening of Ventana At El Corazon in Oceanside', 'text': "Lennar announced the grand opening of Ventana at El Corazon, a new collection of low-maintenance townhome designs boasting spacious and flexible floorplans, technology and a simplified homebuying process through Lennar's Everything's Included® program – all within the expanding El Corazon master plan just three miles from the beach. The public is invited to tour the model home designs and experience the lifestyle at Ventana at El Corazon during a Grand Opening event on Sept. 28 from 10 a.m. to 5:30 p.m. – with children's activities and the Super Q barbeque food truck featured between 11 a.m. and 2 p.m. Ventana at El Corazon's 70 new homes range from 1,659 to 2,312 square feet with up to four bedrooms and 3-1/2 bathrooms. All four distinctive floorplans feature attached garages, spacious living areas, rooftop solar power and modern kitchens – with some models including flexible ground-floor space that can be used as a home office, gym or play area. Prices start in the mid-$500,000s, with the first year's HOA dues paid by Lennar for homes that close by November 29, 2019. All homes include Lennar's signature Everything's Included® program, which ensures that today's most desired new-home features are offered to residents in one package, at no extra cost. Among these are a Wi-Fi CERTIFIED™ package with wireless coverage in every room, green building features such as Energy Star® appliances and rooftop solar power, luxury designs and finishes such as stainless steel appliances and quartz countertops, and extended services that simplify the home buying and owning experience. Ventana at El Corazon is the only for-sale community within the ambitious El Corazon park complex, a 465-acre master-planned area envisioning parks, trails, shopping and a competition aquatic center to complement the 20-field So Cal Sports Complex. El Corazon promises a rural feel in the middle of Oceanside and just minutes from the beach."}{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Lockheed Martin Declares Fourth Quarter 2019 Dividend, Payable on December 27, 2019', 'text': 'The Lockheed Martin Corporation board of directors has authorized a fourth quarter 2019 dividend of $2.40 per share, representing an increase of $0.20 per share over last quarter. The dividend is payable on December 27, 2019, to holders of record as of the close of business on December 2, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2019-09-26 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Enterprise To Build PDH 2 Plant Supported By Long-Term Agreements With Lyondellbasell', 'text': 'ENTERPRISE TO BUILD PDH 2 PLANT; SUPPORTED BY LONG-TERM AGREEMENTS WITH LYONDELLBASELL.LYONDELLBASELL INDUSTRIES NV - CONSTRUCTION OF PDH 2 IS EXPECTED TO PROVIDE ABOUT 1,500 TO 2,000 JOBS.LYONDELLBASELL INDUSTRIES NV - PDH 2 FACILITY IS SCHEDULED TO BEGIN SERVICE IN FIRST HALF OF 2023.'}{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'LyondellBasell to Support Enterprise to Build PDH 2 Plant', 'text': 'LyondellBasell Industries N.V. and Enterprise Products Partners L.P. announced that their respective affiliates have executed long-term contracts that support construction of Enterprise’s second propane dehydrogenation plant. PDH 2 will have the capacity to consume up to 35,000 barrels per day (“BPD”) of propane and produce up to 1.65 billion pounds per year of polymer grade propylene. PDH 2 will be located at Enterprise’s complex in the Mont Belvieu, Texas area. The facility is scheduled to begin service in the first half of 2023.'}{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Marriott International, Inc. Signs Agreement to Introduce The Ritz-Carlton Brand to Montenegro', 'text': 'Marriott International, Inc. announced the signing of agreement with Northstar D.O.O. to bring The Ritz-Carlton brand to Montenegro. Under the plan funded by Al Yasra, The Ritz-Carlton, Montenegro and The Ritz-Carlton Residences, Montenegro are scheduled to bring the brands unrivalled elegance and legendary service to the country in 2023. Design plans for the hotels 120 elegantly appointed guestrooms and suites envision relaxing sanctuaries for guests, with simple local design planned to merge discreetly with contemporary technology, all with the aim of enhancing the natural beauty of the location. The projects plans call for low-rise buildings that would blend into the terrain while maximizing sea and sunset views for guests, residents and visitors alike. The powerful backdrop of the Adriatic is expected to highlight planned recreational amenities, including the propertys main restaurant, two specialty restaurants, a beach bar, indoor and outdoor pools, a salt-water Lido pool, a world-class spa and fitness room, and well-equipped Ritz Kids and Teen clubs. The hotel and residences are planned as part of a mixed-use development that is poised to include sprawling villas, manicured gardens, a yacht club and a sparkling beach cove. The Ritz-Carlton Residences, Montenegro is expected to offer 180 apartments and 48 villas and is scheduled to complete the first phase of construction in 2023, with the final phase scheduled for completion by 2028. Residential sales are slated to begin in 2020.'}{'symbol': 'MA', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Mastercard Incorporated Presents at CyberNext Summit 2019, Oct-08-2019 03:45 PM', 'text': 'Mastercard Incorporated Presents at CyberNext Summit 2019, Oct-08-2019 03:45 PM. Venue: Washington\xa0, District Of Columbia, United States. Speakers: Donnie Wendt.'}{'symbol': 'MCD', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "McDonald's Tests New Plant-Based Burger in Canada", 'text': 'McDonald\'s will be conducting a 12-week test of a new plant-based burger called the P.L.T., which stands for Plant. Lettuce. Tomato. in 28 restaurants in Southwestern Ontario, starting September 30. The P.L.T. is made with a Beyond Meat® plant-based patty that has been crafted exclusively by McDonald\'s, for McDonald\'s, to deliver the iconic taste customers know and love. The McDonald\'s P.L.T. is a delicious, juicy, perfectly dressed plant-based burger on a warm, soft, sesame seed bun with the iconic McDonald\'s taste customers have come to love from McDonald\'s. Featuring a plant-based patty with no artificial colors, artificial flavors, or artificial preservatives, it\'s a great-tasting "open wide and sink your teeth into it" sandwich. The P.L.T. will be priced at CAD 6.49 plus tax.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Medtronic Announces New Clinical Trial to Study Infuse Bone Graft in TLIF Spine Procedures', 'text': "Medtronic plc announced U.S. FDA approval of a prospective, randomized pivotal clinical trial for the use of Infuse™ Bone Graft in Transforaminal Lumbar Interbody Fusion (TLIF) spine procedures. A TLIF is a type of surgery that fuses – or joins – bones of the spine through a posterior approach. It is used to treat certain painful conditions of the lumbar – or low back – region of the spine. Medtronic has initiated site recruitment for the TLIF clinical trial with the potential to enroll up to 50 sites with over 1,000 patients. In 2017, Medtronic announced the FDA approval of a separate clinical trial to study Infuse Bone Graft in Posterolateral Fusion (PLF) procedures. The company is currently enrolling its prospective pilot PLF clinical trial and is working with the FDA to incorporate retrospective safety and effectiveness data sufficient for indication expansion in PLF. Infuse Bone Graft has been on the market since 2002 and has been trusted clinically in over two million patients worldwide to date. The product is FDA-approved for certain spine, oral-maxillofacial and orthopedic trauma surgeries. In spine surgery, Infuse is used with certain Medtronic interbody fusion devices at a single level for patients with degenerative disc disease (DDD) and eliminates the need to harvest bone from the patient's body in a secondary surgical procedure. The use of Infuse Bone Graft in TLIF and PLF procedures is investigational only."}{'symbol': 'MU', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Micron Technology, Inc. Provides Earnings Guidance for First Quarter of Fiscal 2020', 'text': 'MiMicron Technology, Inc. provided earnings guidance for first quarter of 2020. For the quarter, on the GAAP basis, the company expects revenue in the range of $5.0 billion ± $200 million and diluted earnings per share $0.42 ± $0.07.'}{'symbol': 'MSFT', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Red Hat, Inc., Red Hat Forum APAC 2019 - Singapore, Sep 26, 2019', 'text': 'Red Hat, Inc., Red Hat Forum APAC 2019 - Singapore, Sep 26, 2019. Venue: Marina Bay Sands Expo & Convention Centre, Singapore, Singapore. The annual Red Hat Forum gathers industry experts and key business decision makers from diverse backgrounds for dozens of engaging sessions focused on key trends, best practices, and the latest technology, in areas like big data, IoT, IT modernization, cloud, and mobile.'}{'symbol': 'MAA', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'MAA Approves Quarterly Dividend, Payable on October 31, 2019', 'text': 'MAA announced that its board of directors approved a quarterly dividend payment of $0.96 per share of common stock to be paid on October 31, 2019 to shareholders of record on October 15, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'NLOK', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Symantec Corporation Presents at CyberNext Summit 2019, Oct-09-2019 03:00 PM', 'text': 'Symantec Corporation Presents at CyberNext Summit 2019, Oct-09-2019 03:00 PM. Venue: Washington\xa0, District Of Columbia, United States. Speakers: Bret Jordan.'}{'symbol': 'NVR', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'NVR, Inc.(NYSE:NVR) dropped from S&P 400', 'text': 'NVR, Inc.(NYSE:NVR) dropped from S&P 400'}{'symbol': 'ORLY', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "O'Reilly Automotive, Inc. Presents at 43rd Annual Automotive Aftermarket Symposium, Nov-05-2019 01:00 PM", 'text': "O'Reilly Automotive, Inc. Presents at 43rd Annual Automotive Aftermarket Symposium, Nov-05-2019 01:00 PM. Venue: Waldorf Astoria, Las Vegas, Nevada, United States."}{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Oracle Corporation Presents at In-Memory Computing Summit North America, Nov-13-2019', 'text': 'Oracle Corporation Presents at In-Memory Computing Summit North America, Nov-13-2019 . Venue: Hyatt Regency San Francisco Airport, San Francisco, California, United States. Speakers: Douglas Hood, Tirthankar Lahiri, Vice President, Data and In-Memory Technologies.'}{'symbol': 'PENN', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Penn National Gaming, Inc. Announces That William J. Fair, Will Be Stepping Down as Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer, Effective from March 31, 2020', 'text': 'Penn National Gaming, Inc. announced that William J. Fair, will be stepping down as Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer at the conclusion of his current employment contract term, which expires March 31, 2020. Mr. Fair, who has served in his current role as CFO since 2017, joined Penn National in 2014 as Senior Vice President and Chief Development Officer. Mr. Fair has agreed to stay with the Company through the end of the first quarter 2020, which will allow time for the Company to conduct a formal search for his successor and ensure a seamless transition of his responsibilities.'}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Aspen Pharma Indústria Farmacêutica Ltda. acquired Magnesia Bisurada Magnesia Line from Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE).', 'text': 'Aspen Pharma Indústria Farmacêutica Ltda. acquired Magnesia Bisurada Magnesia Line from Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) on September 26, 2019. Magnesia Bisurada Magnesia has sales of BRL 30 million.\nAspen Pharma Indústria Farmacêutica Ltda. completed the acquisition of Magnesia Bisurada Magnesia Line from Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) on September 26, 2019. \n'}{'symbol': 'PM', 'date': '2019-09-26 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Philip Morris CEO says vaping crisis is 'very emotional', will result in regulated market - CNBC", 'text': ':PHILIP MORRIS CEO CALANTZOPOULOS SAYS VAPING PRODUCTS WILL BE BETTER THAN CIGARETTES, BUT THEY HAVE TO GO THROUGH REGULATORY PROCESS'}{'symbol': 'PM', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Philip Morris International Inc. Launches IQOS 3 DUO', 'text': 'Philip Morris International Inc. announced the latest addition to its smoke-free portfolio, IQOS 3 DUO. The continued development of technology exemplified by IQOS 3 DUO—driven by consumer insights and supported by scientific substantiation—represents the company’s latest step in its journey to achieve a smoke-free future and to strengthen its position as a leader in the smoke-free products category. IQOS 3 DUO will be available in Japan this month and subsequently rolled out in most of the markets where IQOS is currently available by the end of 2019. The latest addition, IQOS 3 DUO, is designed with new features to help adult smokers switch from cigarettes more seamlessly. Featuring the fast and most powerful holder within the IQOS family, IQOS 3 DUO allows two consecutive uses without recharging the holder, while the holder charging time is much faster compared to IQOS 3 and IQOS 2.4+.'}{'symbol': 'PPL', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PPL Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 05, 2019', 'text': 'PPL Corporation, Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 05, 2019'}{'symbol': 'PSA', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'New Boston Storage Units Increase Public Storage Footprint by 7%', 'text': 'Public Storage purchased two new climate controlled storage locations that increase the company’s presence in the Boston area by 7%. The newly acquired facilities are Public Storage 671 Washington St., Quincy, MA 02169, the company’s first location in Quincy, and Public Storage 1901 Revere Beach Pkwy, Everett, MA 02149, the company’s second in Everett. Both storage facilities are close to Boston by car and also near stops of “the T” subway system. The modern concrete and glass storage facilities bring more than 2,300 self storage units, and more Public Storage Orange, to communities starved for space.'}{'symbol': 'PHM', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PulteGroup, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 22, 2019', 'text': 'PulteGroup, Inc., Q3 2019 Earnings Call, Oct 22, 2019'}{'symbol': 'QRVO', 'date': '2019-09-26 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Qorvo Announces Pricing Of $350 Million Senior Notes Offering', 'text': 'QORVO ANNOUNCES PRICING OF $350 MILLION SENIOR NOTES OFFERING.QORVO INC - ANNOUNCED PRICING OF ITS OFFERING OF $350 MILLION PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS SENIOR NOTES MATURING IN 2029.QORVO INC - NOTES WILL MATURE ON OCTOBER 15, 2029.QORVO INC - OFFERING WAS UPSIZED FROM A PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED AMOUNT OF $300 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'PWR', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Quanta Services, Inc. Presents at Baird 2019 Global Industrial Conference, Nov-06-2019 10:30 AM', 'text': 'Quanta Services, Inc. Presents at Baird 2019 Global Industrial Conference, Nov-06-2019 10:30 AM. Venue: Four Seasons Hotel, 120 East Delaware Place, Chicago, Illinois, United States. Speakers: Andy Wittman, analyst, Derrick A. Jensen, Chief Financial Officer, Duke Austin, Kip A. Rupp, Vice President of Investor Relations, Paul Craig Gregory, President of Pipeline & Industrial Division and Chief Strategy Officer.'}{'symbol': 'ROST', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "dd's DISCOUNTS to Open a New Store in Tucson, Arizona", 'text': "dd's DISCOUNTS will open a new store in Tucson on September 28, 2019. The 20,000 square foot store is located at Midvale Plaza at the northwest corner of West Valencia Road and South Midvale Park Road. With this new opening, dd's DISCOUNTS will operate 15 stores in Arizona and a total of 260 locations in 19 states. Together, Ross Dress for Less and dd's DISCOUNTSZ currently operate over 1,750 off-price apparel and home fashion stores in 39 states, the District of Columbia, and Guam."}{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "salesforce.com, inc. Presents at L'ATTITUDE, Sep-27-2019 03:45 PM", 'text': "salesforce.com, inc. Presents at L'ATTITUDE, Sep-27-2019 03:45 PM. Venue: Grand Hyatt, Market Place, San Diego, California, United States. Speakers: Marc R. Benioff, Co-Founder, Chairman & Co-CEO."}{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2019-09-26 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Sempra Energy's Subsidiary IEnova Signs Two Long-Term Solar Capacity Agreements With Liverpool And Circle K", 'text': "SEMPRA ENERGY'S SUBSIDIARY IENOVA SIGNS TWO LONG-TERM SOLAR CAPACITY AGREEMENTS WITH LIVERPOOL AND CIRCLE K.SEMPRA ENERGY - $160 MILLION PROJECT IS EXPECTED TO HAVE INSTALLED CAPACITY OF 150 MW & TO BEGIN OPERATIONS IN H2 OF 2020.SEMPRA ENERGY - UNTI SIGNED TWO 15-YEAR CLEAN ENERGY CONTRACTS WITH UNITS OF COMERCIALIZADORA CÍRCULO CCK, S.A. DE CV & EL PUERTO DE LIVERPOOL."}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'outhwest Airlines Puts on Sale New Flights to Cozumel, Mexico, and Accelerates Timeline for Hawaii Service', 'text': "Southwest Airlines Co. extended the carrier's bookable flight schedule through mid-April 2020, bringing new service to beach destinations across the Southwest® map from Hawaii, to Mexico, to Turks & Caicos. This new service is included in the carrier's full flight schedule now available for booking through April 13, 2020, at Southwest.com."}{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Synopsys and TSMC Collaborate to Develop Portfolio of DesignWare IP for TSMC 5nm FinFET Plus (N5P) Process', 'text': "Synopsys, Inc. announced a collaboration with TSMC to develop a broad portfolio of DesignWare® interface IP, logic libraries, embedded memories, and one-time programmable (OTP) non-volatile memory (NVM) IP on TSMC's 5-nanometer (nm) FinFET Plus (N5P) Process. The DesignWare IP solutions for TSMC's N5 process will enable designers to achieve aggressive performance, density, and power targets for their mobile and cloud computing designs. This collaboration reinforces the longstanding relationship between the two companies to provide designers with the high-quality IP needed to lower risk, differentiate their system-on-chips (SoCs), and accelerate their time-to-market. The DesignWare Interface and Foundation IP for TSMC's N5P process are scheduled to be available starting in fourth quarter of 2019."}{'symbol': 'TEL', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Te Connectivity Ltd. Announces to Extend Its Sliver Line of Connectors and Cable Assemblies for SFF-TA-1002', 'text': "TE Connectivity (TE) announced to extend its Sliver line of connectors and cable assemblies for SFF-TA-1002 with new cabled receptacles and cable assemblies that consolidate signal and power into one cost-effective solution. Like previous solutions, this new version complies with the SNIA (Storage Networking Industry Association) Small Form Factor Technology Work Group's SFF-TA-1002 specification, and is among the most robust, cost effective and highest performing solutions on the market. Sliver cabled receptacles for SFF-TA-1002 enable card edge and cabled applications supporting riser card, cable, SSD drive and custom design connectivity. They support high speeds through PCIe Gen 5 with a roadmap to 112G. The dense 0.6mm pitch of the connectors also supports next-generation silicon PCIe lane counts where current products in the market begin to max out. The cable assembly solution connects chip-to-chip, card-to-card or card-to-chip."}{'symbol': 'TSLA', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Tesla 'Has A Shot' At Record 100,000 Cars This Quarter, Musk Says - Electrek", 'text': "Sept 26  - :TESLA 'HAS A SHOT' AT RECORD 100,000 CARS THIS QUARTER - ELECTREK, CITING ELON MUSK'S EMAIL TO EMPLOYEES."}{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2019-09-26 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Trimble And Qualcomm Establish Alliance To Produce High-Accuracy Positioning Solutions For Connected Vehicles', 'text': 'TRIMBLE AND QUALCOMM ESTABLISH ALLIANCE TO PRODUCE HIGH-ACCURACY POSITIONING SOLUTIONS FOR CONNECTED VEHICLES.TRIMBLE INC - CO AND QUALCOMM AIM TO PROVIDE SUB LANE-LEVEL ACCURACY TO AUTOMOTIVE OEMS AND TIER 1 SUPPLIERS.TRIMBLE INC - AN RTX-ENABLED SNAPDRAGON EVALUATION KIT (EVK) IS EXPECTED TO BE AVAILABLE BY EARLY 2020, FOR USE BY AUTOMOTIVE OEMS, TIER 1 SUPPLIERS.'}{'symbol': 'ULTA', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Ulta Beauty, Inc. Presents at L'ATTITUDE, Sep-28-2019 09:30 AM", 'text': "Ulta Beauty, Inc. Presents at L'ATTITUDE, Sep-28-2019 09:30 AM. Venue: Grand Hyatt, Market Place, San Diego, California, United States. Speakers: Mary N. Dillon, CEO & Director."}{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'UPS Turns Up the Volume in Nashville with Expanded High-Speed Hub', 'text': 'UPS announced completion of the multi-phased expansion of its Whitescreek, Tenn. ground package sortation and distribution facility. The project has brought more than 300 new full- and part-time jobs to the area. Businesses and consumers throughout the state will benefit from the expanded sortation and distribution facility’s increased speed, efficiency and reliability. Featuring highly-automated equipment that rapidly moves packages through the scanning and sorting process while capturing data to increase delivery accuracy, the expanded UPS package operations hub is part of a multi-year strategic investment plan to grow UPS’s global smart logistics network. A transfer point for tractor trailers moving packages to destinations beyond Tennessee, the facility also provides pickup and delivery service for customers in Nashville and the surrounding counties.'}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Customers in Boise, Panama City and New York City Get Verizon 5G Ultra Wideband Service', 'text': 'Verizon’s 5G Ultra Wideband network can be accessed in parts of New York City, Panama City and Boise, bringing the total number of Verizon 5G Ultra Wideband mobility service cities to 13. Verizon plans to have 5G access in more than 30 cities by the end of this year. With Verizon’s 5G Ultra Wideband network, can enjoy near real-time experiences with higher capacity, higher throughput and lower latency. That means downloading movies in seconds versus minutes and supporting mobile workforce applications. It’s 5G built right for you, enabling unique experiences that aren’t possible on other networks.'}{'symbol': 'VNO', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Lincoln Property Company and Cara Real Estate acquired 3040 M Street, NW in Washington, DC from Vornado Realty Trust (NYSE:VNO) for $49.8 million.', 'text': 'Lincoln Property Company and Cara Real Estate acquired 3040 M Street, NW in Washington, DC from Vornado Realty Trust (NYSE:VNO) for $49.8 million on September 18, 2019. Lincoln Property Company and Cara Real Estate paid about $1,907 per square foot for 44,000-square-foot building. Eastdil Secured represented Vornado Realty Trust in the transaction.\nLincoln Property Company and Cara Real Estate completed the acquisition of 3040 M Street, NW in Washington, DC from Vornado Realty Trust (NYSE:VNO) on September 18, 2019.\n'}{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Walmart Inc. Presents at L'ATTITUDE, Sep-28-2019 01:15 PM", 'text': "Walmart Inc. Presents at L'ATTITUDE, Sep-28-2019 01:15 PM. Venue: Grand Hyatt, Market Place, San Diego, California, United States. Speakers: Welby Leaman, Senior Director, Global Government Affairs - Americas & Africa."}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Wells Fargo & Company has completed a Fixed-Income Offering in the amount of $24.721 million.', 'text': 'Wells Fargo & Company has completed a Fixed-Income Offering in the amount of $24.721 million.\n\nSecurity Name: Step-Up Rate Senior Unsecured Notes due March 30, 2022\nSecurity Type: Corporate Bond/Note (Non Convertible)\nPrincipal Amount: $24.721 million\nPrice\\Range: 100%\nDiscount Per Security: 0.313%\nSecurity Features: Callable; MTN\nCoupon Type: Step-Up\n'}{'symbol': 'WST', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'West Pharmaceutical Services, Inc. Presents at Biopharma Conclave 2019, Sep-26-2019', 'text': 'West Pharmaceutical Services, Inc. Presents at Biopharma Conclave 2019, Sep-26-2019 . Venue: The St. Regis Mumbai, 462, Tulsi Pipe Rd, Lower Parel, Mumbai\xa0, Maharashtra, India. Speakers: Alagu Subramaniam, Country Manager & Director - India, William B. Matakas Jr., Sr. Director, Product Management, Vial Containment & Delivery.'}{'symbol': 'WRK', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'WestRock Company, Q4 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019', 'text': 'WestRock Company, Q4 2019 Earnings Call, Nov 07, 2019'}{'symbol': 'XEL', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Xcel Energy Inc. to Report Q3, 2019 Results on Oct 24, 2019', 'text': 'Xcel Energy Inc. announced that they will report Q3, 2019 results at 9:00 AM, Eastern Standard Time on Oct 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'ZBRA', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'North Central Sight Services Modernizes Warehouse Operations with Zebra Mobile Computers', 'text': 'Zebra Technologies Corporation announced North Central Sight Services (NCSS) modernized its warehouse operations by improving the accuracy and efficiency of its inventory and picking process and with Zebra’s MC3300 mobile computers running a customized warehouse management system (WMS) from CSSI Technologies. NCSS’s mission is to provide exceptional products, services and employment opportunities to the blind and visually impaired. The organization employs 29 visually impaired workers including its CEO, and it needed a flexible platform to accommodate worker needs. NCSS workers count, package and ship AbilityOne office supplies, flash drives, labels and CD/DVD packs as part of a program under the U.S. AbilityOne Commission. Zebra Registered Independent Software Vendor (ISV) and PartnerConnect Solution Partner, CSSI integrated its WMS solution with Zebra’s MC3300 mobile computers. It also customized the solutions with large characters, color coding and voice-directed picking to help visually impaired employees. WMS by CSSI standardizes about 80% of the functionality on the MC3300 mobile computer, and CSSI customizes the other 20% for each customer. For the NCSS deployment, CSSI enlarged and color-coded text on the MC3300 mobile computers and created “success” and “error” notifications that appear in green or red text respectively along with audible notifications.'}